# Writing fonts are downloaded on demand via FontDownloader for
# merchant-selected fonts. The three platform defaults are
# committed because the storefront must render correctly on the
# very first page load, before any admin save has run.

*

# Directory markers
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore

# Platform default fonts (committed)
!inter/
!inter/*.woff2
!playfair-display/
!playfair-display/*.woff2
!dancing-script/
!dancing-script/*.woff2
